test_command=for t in tests/*_test.sh; do sh "$t" || exit 1; done
id=bump470-01 result=green reason=11 unit tests in tests/bump470_test.sh pass: "bump470-01: VERSION is a semver agreeing with the newest (topmost) CHANGELOG entry -- never a pinned literal" and "bump470-01: VERSION's only content is the version value with one trailing newline" (VERSION reads 4.7.0 + one newline, its only content, agreeing with the topmost [4.7.0] entry); "bump470-01: CHANGELOG.md carries exactly one dated '## [4.7.0] - YYYY-MM-DD' section sitting above the [4.6.0] section which stays above [4.5.0] (relative ordering only -- the stacking lesson), Keep-a-Changelog statement intact"; "bump470-01: the [4.7.0] section uses the file's existing entry style -- category headings with bold lead-in bullets"; six content tests -- entry_describes_header_marker_detection (line-start header comment anchoring at install_file/installed_version_of/the /antz-set-model embedded script, the overwrite-without-backup hole, backups, fresh-install reporting), entry_describes_quoted_descriptions (double-quoted scalars at render_claude/render_opencode/render_set_model_command, backslash-then-quote escaping, byte-for-byte round-trip), entry_describes_antz_ref_derivation (ANTZ_REF/RAW_BASE replacing the hardcoded master, verbatim, a tagged install no longer reads master content, one curl in fetch_file, local-checkout unaffected), entry_describes_cleanup_trap (mktemp scratch removed on every exit path, never the target), entry_describes_policy_and_header_completion (.bak.<timestamp> policy stated, never reads/renames/deletes, cleanup the user's, header names antz-orchestrator and both installed commands), entry_describes_repodocs_correction (AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md "not present yet" fix, exist in the checkout, byte-identical between the two files); "bump470-01: the [4.6.0] section and every entry below it are byte-for-byte unchanged" (the [4.6.0]-down tail cmp-identical to git HEAD)
id=bump470-02 result=green reason=6 unit tests in tests/bump470_test.sh pass: "bump470-02: the [4.7.0] entry grades minor with the versioning-table justification" (grades as **minor**, not patch and not major: install.sh's detection logic and rendered output both change, not wording-only; not major: workflow contract, marker format, access model, directory layout, install locations unchanged, no consumer breaks); "bump470-02: the [4.7.0] entry names the surviving surface concretely" (the marker line's shape, the flags, the rendered frontmatter field set, the install paths survive); "bump470-02: the [4.7.0] entry states agents/prompts/ and agents/meta/ are untouched and no role creates the v4.7.0 tag" (the human's commit-time follow-up, created against the human's bump commit, not pushed automatically); "bump470-02: agents/prompts/ and agents/meta/ are byte-identical to git HEAD while the bump is uncommitted" (change_pending-gated); "bump470-02: no v4.7.0 tag exists while the bump is uncommitted" (change_pending-gated); "bump470-02: the '## Versioning' sections of AGENTS.md and CLAUDE.md are byte-identical to git HEAD" (policy docs out of scope, untouched)
